{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"12.130.117.1","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1fc0a069338b4bd971089d7f9d9010d1","RawContent":"Hi ladies,\n\n\nI am trying to plan a wedding for 2016 fall at The newly redesigned Hyatt Ziva but I&#039;m feeling quite nickel and dimed here. Has anyone gone to meet with the coordinator? Is it worth the prices?? I mean $6 per chair and $2000 for a dance floor is kind of a lot no? Am I just out of the loop on planning a wedding in Mexico? I thought the whole idea of getting married down there is so save money! Any thoughts\/insights would be appreciated. \n\n\nThank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1910493,"PostDate":1454545827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies,<br><br>\nI am trying to plan a wedding for 2016 fall at The newly redesigned Hyatt Ziva but I'm feeling quite nickel and dimed here. Has anyone gone to meet with the coordinator? Is it worth the prices?? I mean $6 per chair and $2000 for a dance floor is kind of a lot no? Am I just out of the loop on planning a wedding in Mexico? I thought the whole idea of getting married down there is so save money! Any thoughts\/insights would be appreciated. <br><br>\nThank you!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryly0929@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.45.185.7","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1454302006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Happiegerl","Id":286099,"Name":"Happiegerl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"200.79.251.123","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"31a60faf3ddd5b3091803a0e8be89d43","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Happiegerl\"] I have done weddings at many resorts in the Riviera Maya. I must those are pretty common prices at some of the Resorts here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I must say there is a huge stigma about Destination wedding in Mexico, saying its affordable! Truth be told ,Destination Wedding are not always affordable. one key factor decide on where you are going to put your money. &amp;nbsp;For example find out the type of dance floor they are charging you for that price? maybe you might want to reply to the coordinator checking the type of dance floor they offer. you might just be offered a second option. &amp;nbsp;Same goes for the chair, what type of chair is it? you might find out that they are charging you a chair based on latest wedding trend.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy Planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910498,"PostDate":1454553132,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"286099\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/286099-happiegerl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Happiegerl<\/span><\/a> I have done weddings at many resorts in the Riviera Maya. I must those are pretty common prices at some of the Resorts here.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I must say there is a huge stigma about Destination wedding in Mexico, saying its affordable! Truth be told ,Destination Wedding are not always affordable. one key factor decide on where you are going to put your money. \u00a0For example find out the type of dance floor they are charging you for that price? maybe you might want to reply to the coordinator checking the type of dance floor they offer. you might just be offered a second option. \u00a0Same goes for the chair, what type of chair is it? you might find out that they are charging you a chair based on latest wedding trend.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Dream Weddings Riviera Maya- We pay attention to your wishes and coordinate closely with you to ensure your wedding or event is planned to perfection! Supporting you brides and help you feel less overwhelmed during the wedding planning process.<\/p>\n<p>Have fun the best is yet to come!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is where I will be posting all videos about most common question about Destination wedding<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/groups\/1664036763874450\/<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Dream Weddings Riviera Maya<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com<\/span><\/span><br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html\">http:\/\/www.dreamweddingsrivieramaya.com\/Home_Page.html<\/a><br><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Happy Planning!<\/span><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);\"><span style=\"font-family:arial;\"><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">Joyce<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"weddingsinplayadelcarmen@gmail.com","IpAddress":"187.252.44.28","GroupId":84,"GroupName":"Insiders w\/ Articles","JoinDate":1326854387,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250090.jpg?_r=1451923195","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"dreamweddings","Id":250090,"Name":"dreamweddings","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb0d8e1fab92b3b957c0c93c919ac8ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@Happiegerl&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding! &amp;nbsp;I was just at the Grand Opening Gala at Hyatt Ziva Cancun that took place last month and met with the Weddings Manager while staying there. &amp;nbsp;The resort is stunning and has great wedding venues. &amp;nbsp;The $6 per chair is very standard with each resort and decor company. &amp;nbsp;As @[member=\"dreamweddings\"] suggested there may be options for the dance floor depending what type and size you require.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;  &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;Feel free to private message me with any questions as I am one of the Canadian TA&#039;s for BDW or&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;contact through this form&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/\" title=\"External link\"&gt;here&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"&gt;if you need help you with planning your dream destination wedding! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910533,"PostDate":1454630243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@Happiegerl\u00a0<span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Congratulations on your upcoming destination wedding! \u00a0I was just at the Grand Opening Gala at Hyatt Ziva Cancun that took place last month and met with the Weddings Manager while staying there. \u00a0The resort is stunning and has great wedding venues. \u00a0The $6 per chair is very standard with each resort and decor company. \u00a0As @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"250090\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/250090-dreamweddings\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">dreamweddings<\/span><\/a> suggested there may be options for the dance floor depending what type and size you require.<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">Feel free to private message me with any questions as I am one of the Canadian TA's for BDW or\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">contact through this form\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/leads\/inquiry\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>here<\/a><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">\u00a0<\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(40,40,40);font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">if you need help you with planning your dream destination wedding! \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448917439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fbd53249627a99f9ff4963be87b6289","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We just booked our wedding for September 2016 at the Hyatt Ziva and their prices are pretty standard. They don&#039;t offer as many perks as other hotels when booking group rooms but I&#039;m just so happy w\/ the location and beach!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"TAPreety\"] - Since you were recently there what room do you recommend for bride and groom to book (we do get a an upgrade I was told ) Any suggestions for the location of cocktail\/reception?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910549,"PostDate":1454688292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We just booked our wedding for September 2016 at the Hyatt Ziva and their prices are pretty standard. They don't offer as many perks as other hotels when booking group rooms but I'm just so happy w\/ the location and beach!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285479\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285479-tapreety\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">TAPreety<\/span><\/a> - Since you were recently there what room do you recommend for bride and groom to book (we do get a an upgrade I was told ) Any suggestions for the location of cocktail\/reception?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445626147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1459291882","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2af680293dfeccd82610f77299c886b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JRodz\"] Welcome to BDW and congrats for your wedding at Hyatt Ziva Cancun! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I posted photos to my agency instagram @travelbyplatinum as you can see the room view I had which was the Hyatt Ziva Dolphin View Master King plus photos around the resort. &amp;nbsp;Double check to what category you will receive for your upgrade but note they are not always guaranteed and based on availability at check-in. &amp;nbsp;For this reason it may be better to pick the category you wish to have for your stay as the views are worth it! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;How many people are expecting to attend? &amp;nbsp;There are some great rooftop terraces depending on size. &amp;nbsp;Where are you planning on having your wedding ceremony?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me know if you have any other questions I am happy to help.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910572,"PostDate":1454719728,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285167-jrodz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JRodz<\/span><\/a> Welcome to BDW and congrats for your wedding at Hyatt Ziva Cancun! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I posted photos to my agency instagram @travelbyplatinum as you can see the room view I had which was the Hyatt Ziva Dolphin View Master King plus photos around the resort. \u00a0Double check to what category you will receive for your upgrade but note they are not always guaranteed and based on availability at check-in. \u00a0For this reason it may be better to pick the category you wish to have for your stay as the views are worth it! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>How many people are expecting to attend? \u00a0There are some great rooftop terraces depending on size. \u00a0Where are you planning on having your wedding ceremony?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me know if you have any other questions I am happy to help.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448917439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.21.204.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2503b0606b48ad3f17cc94fc24cd17f3","RawContent":"Hi TAPreety, we have 40 ppl going working on a 20 room block. Not sure which room best for me and FH. We&#039;re staying 10 days. The rooftop terraces are rooms? Haven&#039;t decided on location yet but thinking beach ceremony or gazebo. \n\n\nCan&#039;t wait to see your pictures!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1910605,"PostDate":1454865109,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi TAPreety, we have 40 ppl going working on a 20 room block. Not sure which room best for me and FH. We're staying 10 days. The rooftop terraces are rooms? Haven't decided on location yet but thinking beach ceremony or gazebo. <br><br>\nCan't wait to see your pictures!!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackiec0176@gmail.com","IpAddress":"208.90.129.99","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1445626147,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285167.jpg?_r=1459291882","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"JRodz","Id":285167,"Name":"JRodz","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.50.165.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79920,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62fa8f46e8539a6d53607228069652c6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"JRodz\"] the rooftop terraces I was referring to are for the wedding location venues. &amp;nbsp;Check with your wedding coordinator what is available for your dates and what would best accommodate your group size.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For your choice of room I would recommend going with a view that you really want. &amp;nbsp;There are some great swim up suites available as well with oceanviews too.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Please let me know if there is anything else?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1910620,"PostDate":1454972190,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"285167\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/285167-jrodz\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">JRodz<\/span><\/a> the rooftop terraces I was referring to are for the wedding location venues. \u00a0Check with your wedding coordinator what is available for your dates and what would best accommodate your group size.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For your choice of room I would recommend going with a view that you really want. \u00a0There are some great swim up suites available as well with oceanviews too.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Please let me know if there is anything else?<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><b>Preety Jaswal - Canadian Wedding Specialist<\/b><\/p>\n<div style=\"font-family:arial, sans-serif;font-size:12.8px;\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.wrighttravelagency.com\/go\/destination-wedding\/?source=EMLSIG' title=\"External link\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings-CLICK HERE<\/span><\/strong><\/a><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px;color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><strong>?<\/strong>\u00a0\u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can\u00a0<\/span><strong><span style=\"color:rgb(0,128,128);\"><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/' title=\"\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/a><\/span><\/strong><\/div>\n","Email":"preety@travelbyplatinum.com","IpAddress":"69.50.165.200","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1448917439,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-285479.jpg?_r=1450836897","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TAPreety","Id":285479,"Name":"TAPreety","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":7,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
